# The companion workflow is a SEPARATE marketplace listing
# (ray9/twilio-spend-airlock). Shipping it inside the module bundle bloats
# the download and makes the signature churn whenever the workflow changes,
# for no benefit to a buyer of the module.
workflow/

# Listing copy — belongs to the marketplace record (passed via --description
# at publish time), not to the code buyers install.
LISTING.md

# Byte-compiled handler cache. Never part of the signed tree — it is derived
# from handler.py, differs per Python version, and would break the tree hash
# on any machine that imported the module before the bundle was assembled.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
